    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dreams and Neuroscience! The ARPG &quot;Lost Dream Chronicle&quot; is Coming Soon!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By day, teach and nurture; by night, explore dreams. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >experience the dual life of chemistry teacher &amp; alchemist &quot;Xiao Nan&quot;!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the psychoanalysis theory of the popular psychologist Freud, the game seamlessly combines campus life simulation with a 3D sandbox Metroidvania!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What you think about during the day shapes your dreams at night. Your actions in the real world during the day will have a major impact on the dream world at night!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unveil mysteries, understand yourself, and save the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Teacher Simulator? Daytime Campus Life...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the day in the game, live out a full day as a novice high school teacher, experiencing the hardships, growth, and joy unique to educators!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110510/extras/72e4c0b9f2c747e86acfc9aa7f7a2fd6.poster.avif?t=1751850736\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110510/extras/72e4c0b9f2c747e86acfc9aa7f7a2fd6.webm?t=1751850736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110510/extras/72e4c0b9f2c747e86acfc9aa7f7a2fd6.mp4?t=1751850736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >3D Metroidvania! Nighttime Alchemist Dream Adventures!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At night in the game, transform into an alchemist and enjoy exhilarating arcade-style light-gun shooting, combined with dodging, parrying, executions, and stealth actions to explore various uniquely styled dream worlds!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110510/extras/5f2776c19fe8152e9c353773376bb449.poster.avif?t=1751850736\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110510/extras/5f2776c19fe8152e9c353773376bb449.webm?t=1751850736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110510/extras/5f2776c19fe8152e9c353773376bb449.mp4?t=1751850736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Experience life as a solo-living girl? Decorate your own apartment!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the evening in the game, begin your unique solitary life! Purchase furniture, daily necessities, toys, and even video games from the mall! The cozier your home, the stronger you will be in your dreams!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110510/extras/38943a5c955a4657f0a557b3001ea790.poster.avif?t=1751850736\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110510/extras/38943a5c955a4657f0a557b3001ea790.webm?t=1751850736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110510/extras/38943a5c955a4657f0a557b3001ea790.mp4?t=1751850736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Prepare your dreams! Dream by night what one thinks by day!  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various activities before sleep will generate corresponding &quot;neural memories&quot;! Your daytime actions will profoundly influence the dream environment and RPG intensity of characters at night! Actively prepare for your dreams!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110510/extras/24973afe29a7f36500bc3ad3448886d5.poster.avif?t=1751850736\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110510/extras/24973afe29a7f36500bc3ad3448886d5.webm?t=1751850736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110510/extras/24973afe29a7f36500bc3ad3448886d5.mp4?t=1751850736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dreams and Neuroscience! The ARPG &quot;Lost Dream Chronicle&quot; is Coming Soon!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By day, teach and nurture; by night, explore dreams. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >experience the dual life of chemistry teacher &amp; alchemist &quot;Xiao Nan&quot;!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the psychoanalysis theory of the popular psychologist Freud, the game seamlessly combines campus life simulation with a 3D sandbox Metroidvania!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What you think about during the day shapes your dreams at night. Your actions in the real world during the day will have a major impact on the dream world at night!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unveil mysteries, understand yourself, and save the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Teacher Simulator? Daytime Campus Life...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the day in the game, live out a full day as a novice high school teacher, experiencing the hardships, growth, and joy unique to educators!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110510/extras/72e4c0b9f2c747e86acfc9aa7f7a2fd6.poster.avif?t=1751850736\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110510/extras/72e4c0b9f2c747e86acfc9aa7f7a2fd6.webm?t=1751850736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110510/extras/72e4c0b9f2c747e86acfc9aa7f7a2fd6.mp4?t=1751850736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >3D Metroidvania! Nighttime Alchemist Dream Adventures!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At night in the game, transform into an alchemist and enjoy exhilarating arcade-style light-gun shooting, combined with dodging, parrying, executions, and stealth actions to explore various uniquely styled dream worlds!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110510/extras/5f2776c19fe8152e9c353773376bb449.poster.avif?t=1751850736\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110510/extras/5f2776c19fe8152e9c353773376bb449.webm?t=1751850736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110510/extras/5f2776c19fe8152e9c353773376bb449.mp4?t=1751850736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Experience life as a solo-living girl? Decorate your own apartment!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the evening in the game, begin your unique solitary life! Purchase furniture, daily necessities, toys, and even video games from the mall! The cozier your home, the stronger you will be in your dreams!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110510/extras/38943a5c955a4657f0a557b3001ea790.poster.avif?t=1751850736\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110510/extras/38943a5c955a4657f0a557b3001ea790.webm?t=1751850736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110510/extras/38943a5c955a4657f0a557b3001ea790.mp4?t=1751850736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Prepare your dreams! Dream by night what one thinks by day!  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various activities before sleep will generate corresponding &quot;neural memories&quot;! Your daytime actions will profoundly influence the dream environment and RPG intensity of characters at night! Actively prepare for your dreams!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110510/extras/24973afe29a7f36500bc3ad3448886d5.poster.avif?t=1751850736\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110510/extras/24973afe29a7f36500bc3ad3448886d5.webm?t=1751850736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110510/extras/24973afe29a7f36500bc3ad3448886d5.mp4?t=1751850736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
